  "answer_text": "The Indiana Pacers **did not make the playoffs** for the 2025\u201326 NBA season. They finished the regular season with a 19\u201363 record and were the first team in the league to be eliminated from postseason contention. \n\nHowever, if you are looking for their opponents from their most recent playoff appearances, here is who they played:\n\n### **2025 NBA Playoffs** (Their Most Recent Postseason Appearance)\nThe Pacers made a surprising run all the way to the NBA Finals:\n* **First Round:** Beat the **Milwaukee Bucks** (4\u20131)\n* **Eastern Conference Semifinals:** Beat the **Cleveland Cavaliers** (4\u20131)\n* **Eastern Conference Finals:** Beat the **New York Knicks** (4\u20132)\n* **NBA Finals:** Lost to the **Oklahoma City Thunder** (3\u20134)\n\n### **2024 NBA Playoffs**\nThe Pacers reached the Eastern Conference Finals:\n* **First Round:** Beat the **Milwaukee Bucks** (4\u20132)\n* **Eastern Conference Semifinals:** Beat the **New York Knicks** (4\u20133)\n* **Eastern Conference Finals:** Lost to the **Boston Celtics** (0\u20134)",
